      "name": "GetCelContextInfo",
      "signature": "void GetCelContextInfo(void * pGfxInfo, void * pCelContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Populates CelContext unit info fields from GfxInfo and COF data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract component index from CelContext at offset 0x1d\n2. Copy unit type and mode from GfxInfo to CelContext offsets 0x24, 0x28\n3. Look up component code string from g_aszComponentCodes table\n4. Look up weapon class string from g_aszWeaponClassCodes table\n5. Set default \"lit \" lighting token at offset 0x38\n6. Assert GfxInfo has valid COF data pointer at offset 0xb8\n7. Call GetCofData to retrieve COF layer information\n8. Iterate COF layer records (stride 9) to find matching component\n9. Set direction flag based on unit type threshold (0/1 for <7/>=7)\n10. Build 4-char weapon class code, replacing null bytes with spaces\n\nParameters:\n- pGfxInfo (void*): Pointer to source GfxInfo structure\n- pCelContext (void*): Pointer to destination CelContext structure\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1d: Component index offset in CelContext\n- 0x24: dwUnitType offset in CelContext\n- 0x28: dwMode offset in CelContext\n- 0x30: dwUnitToken offset in CelContext\n- 0x34: dwComponentCode offset in CelContext\n- 0x38: dwLit offset in CelContext\n- 0x3c: dwArmorType offset in CelContext\n- 0x40: dwWClass offset in CelContext\n- 0xb8: COF data pointer offset in GfxInfo\n- 0x2074696c: \"lit \" default lighting token\n- 0x20787878: \"xxx \" default placeholder\n- 0x9: COF layer record stride\n- 0xf (15): Max component index (NUM_COMPONENTS - 1)\n- 0x7: Unit type threshold for direction flag",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
