      "name": "SetCompositeUnitStrings",
      "signature": "void SetCompositeUnitStrings(CompositeUnit * pUnit, Unicode * pwszStr1, Unicode * pwszStr2, Unicode * pwszStr3, Unicode * pwszStr4, DWORD dwOpt1, DWORD dwOpt2)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets string fields and options on a CompositeUnit structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit is not NULL (assert on failure, calls FUN_6f91436d to exit)\n2. Copy pwszStr1 to pUnit->wszString1 at offset 0xCC via Unicode::strcpy\n3. Copy pwszStr2 to pUnit->wszString2 at offset 0x14C via Unicode::strcpy\n4. Copy pwszStr3 to pUnit->wszString3 at offset 0x1CC via Unicode::strcpy\n5. Copy pwszStr4 to pUnit->wszString4 at offset 0x1EC via Unicode::strcpy\n6. Store dwOpt1 at pUnit->dwOption1 (offset 0x22C)\n7. Store dwOpt2 at pUnit->dwOption2 (offset 0x230)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (CompositeUnit*): Pointer to CompositeUnit structure (asserted non-NULL)\n- pwszStr1 (Unicode*): Unicode string copied to wszString1 field\n- pwszStr2 (Unicode*): Unicode string copied to wszString2 field\n- pwszStr3 (Unicode*): Unicode string copied to wszString3 field\n- pwszStr4 (Unicode*): Unicode string copied to wszString4 field\n- dwOpt1 (DWORD): Option value stored in dwOption1 field\n- dwOpt2 (DWORD): Option value stored in dwOption2 field\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
