      "name": "SetTextFieldValue",
      "signature": "void SetTextFieldValue(int * pTextField, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validates and delegates text field value assignment to scrollbar control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTextField is not null\n2. Validate control type field (offset 0) equals 4 (text field type)\n3. Call Ordinal_10202 to assign nValue to control structure at offset 0x90\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- pTextField (int*): Pointer to text field control structure\n- nValue (int): Value to assign to control structure field\n\nReturns:\n- void: No explicit return; asserts and terminates on validation failure",
