      "name": "SetUnitField14",
      "signature": "void SetUnitField14(CompositeUnit * pUnit, dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets a unit structure field at offset 0x14 to the specified value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load pUnit from stack parameter\n2. Test if pUnit equals null (zero)\n3. If null, push assertion parameters (line 0xe22, file pointer, arg pointer)\n4. Call FogAssert to report assertion failure\n5. Call AssertFailure(0xffffffff) to terminate\n6. If not null, load dwValue from second stack parameter\n7. Store dwValue to memory at pUnit + 0x14\n8. Return to caller with stack cleanup\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (CompositeUnit*): Pointer to unit structure, must not be null\n- dwValue (dword): 32-bit value to store at unit structure offset 0x14\n\nReturns:\n- void (function does not return if pUnit is null, assertion fails)",
