      "name": "InitPaletteColorTables",
      "signature": "void InitPaletteColorTables(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes all game palette color transform tables by loading from resource files.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each of 8 palette categories (default, brown, greybrown, etc.):\n   a. Construct full file path by concatenating base path with palette name\n   b. Open async file handle using constructed path\n   c. If file open succeeds:\n      - Read binary palette data via ReadTransformData\n      - Close file handle via CloseFileHandleIfValid\n   d. If file open fails:\n      - Log warning to debug output\n      - Zero-initialize 0x540-entry (1344 dword) palette table\n2. After all 8 palettes loaded, call LoadColorTransformData twice with special palette IDs\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: No parameters\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100 (256): Temporary buffer size for path construction\n- 0x540 (1344): Palette table entry count\n- 0x1500 (5376): Palette data size in bytes (1344 * 4 bytes)\n- 0x104 (260): Stack frame size for buffer and temporary variables",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:20ee0a527b97f8e4c18a134caf3eac06",
