      "name": "CalculateCharacterTitleTier",
      "signature": "void CalculateCharacterTitleTier(int nContext, int nLevel, int nBonus, int nClassId)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Calculate skill tier based on character level and class.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Determine base tier threshold based on nClassId (0 = standard, non-zero = special)\n2. Map nLevel to base tier (0-3 levels): levels 0-3\u21920, 4-7\u21921, 8-11\u21922, 12+\u21923\n3. Add 3 to tier if nBonus bonus is active and tier is non-zero\n4. Pass calculated nTier to Ordinal_10160 for further processing\n\nParameters:\n- hContext: Context handle\n- nLevel: Character level (determines base tier)\n- nBonus: Bonus flag (adds 3 to tier when set)\n- nClassId: Class identifier (affects tier thresholds)\n\nReturns:\n- void (processes tier through Ordinal_10160)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:b929480af34fb851e8a8b613fddb3059",
