      "name": "CopyAccountString",
      "signature": "dword CopyAccountString(dword * pAccountData, byte * pszDest)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Copies a string from an account structure to destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate account data structure type (must be 0xC)\n2. Get string pointer from offset 0x44 of account data\n3. Calculate string length using strlen-like loop\n4. Copy string in 4-byte chunks (optimization via MOVSD)\n5. Copy remaining bytes individually\n6. Return 1 on success, 0 if source is NULL\n\nParameters:\n- pAccountData (dword *): Pointer to account structure\n- pszDest (byte *): Destination buffer to receive string copy\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if copy succeeded\n- 0 if source string was NULL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
