      "name": "GetAnimationField",
      "signature": "int GetAnimationField(int * pAnim)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Returns animation data field after validating structure type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pAnim type field equals 2\n2. Assert on type mismatch (does not return)\n3. Return animation field at offset 0x14\n\nParameters:\n- pAnim (int*): Animation structure pointer\n  - [0x00]: Type field (must equal 2)\n  - [0x14]: Animation data field\n\nReturns:\n- int: Value from pAnim[0x14]",
