      "name": "ValidateCelBounds",
      "signature": "dword ValidateCelBounds(int * pCelInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Validates whether a Cel sprite fits within screen boundaries.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify pCelInfo parameter type is 2\n2. Extract table index from pCelInfo[0x10] and pCelInfo[0x14]\n3. Load CelFileInfo for the cel (width, height, mode, etc.)\n4. Check bounds: cel must fit within screen with margins\n5. Return 1 if valid, 0 if out of bounds\n\nParameters:\n- pCelInfo (int *): Cel information structure, pCelInfo[0] must equal 2\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if cel fits within screen bounds\n- 0 if cel exceeds screen boundaries\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10, 0x14: Offsets into pCelInfo structure\n- 0x73: Line number in FogAssert\n- 0xffffffff: Error code for assertion failure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
