      "name": "LoadCelImage",
      "signature": "void * LoadCelImage(char * szPath, DWORD dwGameStructureId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Loads a CEL image file from the given path and allocates CEL image data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate string length of input path via string scan\n2. Copy input path to local buffer (260-byte stack buffer)\n3. Retrieve game structure selector from parameter\n4. Concatenate local path with game structure selector path\n5. Call FUN_6f913fa2 to create CEL file handle\n6. Allocate CEL image data via AllocateCelImageData\n7. Return CEL file handle (or NULL if allocation failed)\n\nParameters:\n- szPath (char*): CEL file path\n- dwGameStructureId (DWORD): Game structure identifier\n\nReturns:\n- void*: Pointer to CEL file data structure, or NULL on failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260): Local buffer size for path concatenation\n- 0x41 (65): Flag parameter to FUN_6f913fa2\n- 0x42 (66): Flag parameter to AllocateCelImageData",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
