      "signature": "dword LoadCelImageWithStructurePath(char * lpszFilename, int * pdwOutput, dword dwStructId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Loads a CEL image file by combining game structure path with source filename.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Measures and copies source filename to local 260-byte buffer\n2. Gets game structure path via GetGameStructureSelector\n3. Concatenates structure path with buffered filename\n4. Loads CEL file data via LoadAsyncFileData\n5. Allocates CEL image data structure via AllocateCelImageData\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFilename (char*): Source CEL filename\n- pdwOutput (int*): Output data pointer\n- dwStructId (dword): Game structure selector ID\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Handle or status value (from EBX)",
