      "name": "IsCharExpansionPresent",
      "signature": "bool IsCharExpansionPresent(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Checks if D2CHAR.MPQ expansion file is present, first in install path then in char path.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get installation path\n2. Append d2char.mpq filename\n3. Check file existence with GetFileAttributesA\n4. If not found (0xffffffff), copy char path and retry\n5. Return true if file not found, false if found (inverted logic)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- true if expansion is NOT present\n- false if expansion file was found\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104: Buffer size (260 bytes for MAX_PATH)\n- 0xffffffff: GetFileAttributesA INVALID_FILE_ATTRIBUTES",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:3c8584d1872b9fc325a6792697009d63",
