      "name": "InitializeD2MpqData",
      "signature": "uint InitializeD2MpqData(void * pMpqHandle, uint dwMpqPriority, int nExpansionIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Initializes D2 MPQ data by loading either base or expansion MPQ file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check expansion flag via GetExpansionFlag()\n2. Clear pMpqHandle if expansion is active\n3. Load appropriate MPQ file via FUN_6f91404b based on nExpansionIndex:\n   - If index=0: Load base D2VIDEO MPQ file\n   - If index!=0: Load expansion D2EXPANSION MPQ file\n4. Store result in g_pD2LocalMpq or g_pD2CdExpMpq\n\nParameters:\n- pMpqHandle (void*): Placeholder buffer (cleared if expansion active)\n- dwMpqPriority (uint): Priority value for MPQ loader\n- nExpansionIndex (int): 0 for base, non-zero for expansion\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on successful MPQ load\n- 0 if MPQ loading failed",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
