      "name": "SetButtonFrameValues",
      "signature": "void SetButtonFrameValues(dword * pButtonData, dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets button frame dimension values. Validates button data type before setting width/height fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify button data structure type field equals 6 (BUTTON type)\n2. Assert fails with diagnostic path/line if type mismatch, terminates execution\n3. Write dwValue to button frame width field (offset 0x44)\n4. Write dwValue to button frame height field (offset 0x48)\n\nParameters:\n- pButtonData (dword*): Pointer to button structure, verified at offset 0x0\n- dwValue (dword): Frame dimension value (width/height)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6: Expected button type constant\n- 0x44 (68): Offset to frame width field\n- 0x48 (72): Offset to frame height field",
