      "name": "SetButtonDataFields",
      "signature": "void SetButtonDataFields(int * pBtnData, int nValue, ushort wStringId, int nState)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets button data field values. Validates button type and configures text string and state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify button type is 6 (type check via assertion)\n2. Store nValue at offset 0x18 in button structure\n3. Store nState at offset 0x99 in button structure\n4. Validate wStringId as valid string identifier\n5. Copy string data to button text field at offset 0x19\n\nParameters:\n- pBtnData (int*): Pointer to button data structure (must have type 6)\n- nValue (int): Value to store at offset 0x18\n- wStringId (ushort): String table ID to validate and copy\n- nState (int): State value to store at offset 0x99\n\nReturns:\n- void (on success); aborts via FUN_6f91436d if type check fails\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 6: Expected button type identifier\n- 0x18 (24): Offset for value field\n- 0x99 (153): Offset for state field\n- 0x19 (25): Offset for text string field",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
