      "name": "D2WIN_ButtonOnClick",
      "signature": "void D2WIN_ButtonOnClick(int * pButton)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Invokes button click handler and callback functions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify button structure type (expect 0x6 at offset 0)\n2. Call button click handler (function pointer at offset 0x24)\n3. Set button state flag at offset 0x4c to 1\n4. Call button callback (function pointer at offset 0x28) if present\n5. Increment global counter, invoke callback with stack frame, decrement counter\n\nParameters:\n- pButton (int*): Pointer to button structure with handlers and callbacks\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Function does not return if button structure validation fails (fatal error)\n- Global counter at 0x6f961530 tracks callback nesting depth",
