      "name": "ProcessButtonClick",
      "signature": "int ProcessButtonClick(int * pBtnData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes button click event and invokes registered callback if conditions are met.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate button type is 6 (button assertion)\n2. Check button state flags against bitmask conditions\n3. If both conditions met, toggle or set button flags based on mode\n4. Invoke button's registered callback if depth allows\n\nParameters:\n- pBtnData (int*): Pointer to button data array [0] = pointer to button info structure\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if button callback executed, 0 if conditions not met",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
