      "name": "D2Win_GetEditBoxChild",
      "signature": "int * D2Win_GetEditBoxChild(int * pData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int *",
      "comment": "Extract child window pointer from D2Win edit control structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test if input pointer pData is NULL\n2. If NULL, call FogAssert and AssertFailure to terminate\n3. Check if first field of structure equals 1 (type validation)\n4. If not 1, call FogAssert and AssertFailure to terminate\n5. Calculate and return pointer at offset 0x5C (child window field)\n\nParameters:\n- pData (int*): Edit control structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- int*: Pointer to child window field at offset 0x5C\n- Never returns on validation failure (AssertFailure terminates)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
