      "name": "InitializeFontTable",
      "signature": "void InitializeFontTable(int nFontIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize font table entry by creating a font handle for the specified font index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Build full path string using wsprintfA with base path and flags\n2. Validate string length doesn't exceed 0x4e (78 bytes)\n3. Select font table based on game mode (in-game chat vs normal)\n4. Format label string with path, table pointer, and font pointer\n5. Release any existing allocation for this font index\n6. Create new font handle via FUN_6f913fa2\n7. Store handle in font heap and data pointer arrays\n\nParameters:\n- nFontIndex (ECX): Font index in array (0-based)\n\nReturns:\n- void (results stored in g_pFontHeap and g_pFontDataPtrs arrays)\n\nRelated:\n- g_pFontHeap: Array of font handles\n- g_bGameMode: Flag indicating in-game chat mode (0x0d triggers chat font)\n- ReleasePoolAllocation: Frees existing allocation before recreating",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:23a7732e6be141bdfb0882d45c61e11c",
