      "name": "RenderWrappedUnicodeText",
      "signature": "void RenderWrappedUnicodeText(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders Unicode text with dynamic line wrapping based on width and height constraints.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize with current font index and get text length via Unicode::strlen\n2. Calculate line count by counting newline characters (0x0a) in string\n3. Compute total text height based on character metrics and line count\n4. Check if text fits in available space, break if insufficient height\n5. Conditionally set font for alignment (mode 1 vs 6) via Ordinal_10127\n6. Calculate horizontal position based on alignment mode and available width\n7. Compute scaled height and effect offset for rendering\n8. If effect enabled: render effect layer with scale calculations\n9. Render main text layer with computed positioning parameters\n10. Call FUN_6f90c6a0 to finalize text output\n11. Restore original font if changed\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_nCurrentFontIndex contains active font\n- IMPLICIT: g_pszStringBuffer points to Unicode text to render\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: Byte offset for character height in font structure\n- 0x14: Font handle array stride (20 bytes per entry)\n- 0xa: Character code for newline in Unicode strings\n- 0x1f: Height padding constant (31 pixels)\n- 0x5: Width margin/padding (5 pixels)\n- 0x66666667: Magic constant for signed division by 10\n- 0x7: Right shift count for effect scale calculation\n- 0x50: Character code passed to Ordinal_10034 (font char)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10041: Get drawable area dimensions\n- Ordinal_10055: Render text layer with positioning\n- Ordinal_10127: Set font mode\n- Ordinal_10034: Get character properties\n- FUN_6f90c5d0: Calculate text metrics\n- FUN_6f90c6a0: Finalize text rendering",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:1588a3357e80f996cb7740f4be5f9d51",
