      "name": "RenderTooltipText",
      "signature": "void RenderTooltipText(Unicode * pszText, dword nX, int nY)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Renders tooltip text within bounds, calculating dimensions and handling line wrapping.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate display width of text and line count\n2. Validate text pointer is non-NULL\n3. Measure total height required for all lines\n4. Clamp X position and height within display boundaries\n5. Render text with color support at calculated position\n\nParameters:\n- pszText (Unicode*): Unicode string to render\n- nX (dword): X position for text rendering\n- nY (int): Y position for text rendering\n- IMPLICIT: EBX contains maximum Y boundary, ESI contains maximum X boundary\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- RenderUnicodeStringWithColors: Handles actual text rendering\n- GetStringDisplayWidth: Calculates string width in pixels",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:f80c002be2b2efe7c4c0aadb0a1ac29e",
