      "name": "ProcessCelFileData",
      "signature": "void ProcessCelFileData(void * this, void * pThis, int nFrameIndex, dword dwParam, int nStartOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Processes cel file frame data with optional transformations and rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get total frame count from cel file\n2. Initialize CelFileInfo structures for processing\n3. If transformation mode (dwParam==1 or 2): Calculate cumulative offsets across frames\n4. For each frame: Call appropriate rendering function (Ordinal_10072/10073) with calculated offset\n5. Increment offset by 0x100 for next frame iteration\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (void*): Cel file object pointer\n- nFrameIndex (int): Frame index for processing\n- dwParam (dword): Transformation mode (1=mode1, 2=mode2, other=default)\n- nStartOffset (int): Initial offset value for first frame\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x12: Loop counter for structure initialization (18 dwords)\n- 0x100: Frame offset increment per iteration\n- 0xffffffff: Sentinel value for parameter (-1 in signed context)",
