      "name": "ReleaseLinkedListWithAllocation",
      "signature": "void ReleaseLinkedListWithAllocation(LinkedListNode * pListHead)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Iterates through a linked list and releases allocated nodes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pListHead is non-NULL; if NULL, return immediately\n2. Enter loop at first node\n3. Load next node pointer from current node's pNext field\n4. Call ReleasePoolAllocation for current node's data\n5. Call ReleasePoolAllocation for current node itself\n6. Move to next node and repeat while pNext is non-NULL\n\nParameters:\n- pListHead (LinkedListNode*): Pointer to first node in linked list; NULL terminates immediately\n\nReturns:\n- void: Function always succeeds; does not return status code\n\nStructure Layout:\n- LinkedListNode.data (offset 0x0, uint): Node payload data\n- LinkedListNode.pNext (offset 0x4, void*): Pointer to next node",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:aafe1ba7c0cb6f9f78ec0353d527e3e5",
