      "comment": "Processes click events on Type 2 UI elements with sub-region hit testing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get image data pointer from UI element structure at offset [0]\n2. Assert element type equals 2 (Type 2 UI element validation)\n3. Check visibility flags via gdwBitMasks_exref bitmasks at offsets +0 and +8\n4. If not visible (either bitmask fails), return 0 immediately\n5. Get sub-region table pointer from offset [0x12]\n6. Calculate adjusted X position: (element[6] - element[4]) + g_nScreenWidth\n7. If sub-region table exists, iterate through regions (5 dwords each):\n   a. Check Y bounds: regionY <= (g_nScreenHeight - elementY) < (regionY + regionHeight)\n   b. Check X bounds: (regionX - regionWidth) <= adjustedX < regionX\n   c. If hit, call region handler at piSubRegions[regionIndex * 5 + 4](pUIElement)\n   d. Advance by 5 dwords per region, check next entry flag at offset +9\n8. If no sub-region matched and default handler exists at offset [0xd]:\n   a. Call default handler: element[0xd](pUIElement)\n9. Return handler result or 0 if no handler invoked\n\nParameters:\n- pUIElement (Stack+4): Pointer to UI element structure\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Handler return value, or 0 if no click processed\n\nStructure Layout (UI Element Type 2, 0x4c bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n0x00    4     eType           Element type (must be 2)\n0x04    4     dwFlags         Flags combined with gdwBitMasks\n0x08    4     dwMaskBits      Visibility mask bits\n0x0c    4     nY              Y coordinate\n0x10    4     nX              X coordinate\n0x14    4     nWidth          Width\n0x18    4     nHeight         Height\n0x34    4     pfnCallback     Default click handler function pointer\n0x48    4     pSubRegions     Pointer to sub-region table\n\nSub-Region Entry (20 bytes / 5 dwords):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n0x00    4     nY              Region Y position\n0x04    4     nX              Region X position\n0x08    4     nHeight         Region height\n0x0c    4     nWidth          Region width\n0x10    4     pfnHandler      Region click handler\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 if element type assertion fails (after crash)\n- Returns 0 if visibility flags not set\n- Returns 0 if no sub-region matched and no default handler\n- Sub-region iteration stops when entry flag at offset +9 is 0",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:052a101a230c3ddc22bbf8ff66201a19",
