      "comment": "Initializes game data in a recursive chain pattern.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call InitializeCompressedGameData with the size parameter\n2. Recursively call thunk with buffer ptr set to 0x6f90f2c0\n\nParameters:\n- pData (void*): Opaque data pointer passed through recursion\n- pBuffer (void*): Buffer pointer (set to 0x6f90f2c0 on recursion)\n- pContext (void*): Opaque context pointer passed through\n- nSize (int): Size or config parameter for initialization\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Exported ordinal 10000 from D2Win.dll\n- Acts as initialization wrapper with chained recursive processing",
