      "name": "InitializeGameEngine",
      "signature": "uint InitializeGameEngine(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Initializes the game engine by clearing global state and setting up message queues.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear g_dwInitialized flag to reset engine state\n2. Clear g_dwQueueState flag for message queue\n3. Call InitializeAndCleanupQueues with fCleanup=true\n4. Call Ordinal_10024 for core initialization\n5. Return 1 to indicate success\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: None (entry point initialization)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (always succeeds)",
