      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes graphics system with mode control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store initialization mode to global state\n2. If mode is 1, initialize and cleanup queues\n3. Call mode-specific ordinal function\n4. If mode is 1, initialize graphics system with specific memory parameters\n\nParameters:\n- nInitMode (int): Initialization mode (1 = full init, other = partial)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x800000 (8388608): Graphics memory size\n- 0x7d000 (516096): Buffer allocation size",
