      "name": "ProcessInventoryItem",
      "signature": "int ProcessInventoryItem(int nItem)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes inventory item, managing linked lists for active and free inventory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear references to pItem from current/last input time globals\n2. If pItem is list head, update head to next node and clear item link\n3. If no inventory list, return 0 (empty)\n4. If pItem is list head, add to free list\n5. Otherwise, traverse list to find and remove pItem\n6. Add pItem to end of free list\n\nParameters:\n- pItem (int): Inventory item pointer (handle)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 if inventory list is empty\n\nStructure Layout:\n- Offset 0x3c: Next item pointer in linked list",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:67c20f40b7b69d38492dd1d5b4501135",
