      "name": "IsPointInRect",
      "signature": "void IsPointInRect(RECT * pRect)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Checks if the screen position (g_nScreenWidth, g_nScreenHeight) lies within the specified rectangle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create POINT structure with current screen coordinates\n2. Call PtInRect to test point against rectangle bounds\n3. Return result (implicitly via EAX)\n\nParameters:\n- pRect (RECT*): Rectangle bounds to test against (left, top, right, bottom)\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (non-zero) if point is within rectangle bounds\n- FALSE (zero) if point is outside rectangle bounds\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- g_nScreenWidth: Current mouse/cursor X coordinate\n- g_nScreenHeight: Current mouse/cursor Y coordinate",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:a7735a8b064f7e7774ef0663c2e58dcf",
