      "name": "ValidateCharacterData",
      "signature": "dword ValidateCharacterData(Unicode * pCharName)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Validates and registers a character in the current screen data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify current screen is popup type (0xb), assert if not\n2. Check if character count (at offset 0x10) exceeds 7, return 0 if true\n3. Copy character data (33 dwords) to screen data at calculated offset\n4. Call Ordinal_10127 to trigger character redraw update\n5. Calculate character value via SumCharacterValues\n6. Update max value field, increment character count, update display stride\n\nParameters:\n- pCharName (Unicode *): Pointer to character data to register\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 if character limit exceeded or screen type invalid",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:a71bd90035a439e402113798f5589cc6",
