      "name": "ScrollbarGetField14",
      "signature": "int ScrollbarGetField14(int * pdwScrollbar)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Retrieves scrollbar field at offset 0x14.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate scrollbar structure type (eType must be 5)\n2. If invalid, trigger FogAssert and terminate with error code\n3. Return field at offset 0x14 (20 bytes) from scrollbar\n\nParameters:\n- pdwScrollbar (int *): Scrollbar structure pointer, must have eType==5 at offset 0\n\nReturns:\n- Value at scrollbar offset 0x14 on success\n- Does not return on assertion failure",
