      "comment": "Processes scrollbar mouse position updates and adjusts scrollbar position.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates control state and event type\n2. Checks if control is enabled and visible\n3. Calculates scrollbar position based on mouse coordinates\n4. Updates position value with clamping\n5. Invokes optional callbacks if registered\n\nParameters:\n- pControl (int*): Pointer to scrollbar control structure\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success, 0 on validation failure",
