      "name": "SetCJKFontHeight",
      "signature": "void SetCJKFontHeight(int nFontSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets the CJK (Chinese/Japanese/Korean) font height based on language locale.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current language locale ID (7=Chinese, 9=Japanese/Korean)\n2. Call font metrics function to get character height\n3. If height > 13: use 8-pixel font\n4. Otherwise: use 6 or 7-pixel font based on comparison\n\nParameters:\n- nFontSize (ECX): Font size identifier\n\nReturns:\n- void (sets global g_dwCJKFontHeight as side effect)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:7ea31cb8c4a6684050612c2e8d37be78",
