      "name": "SetTextBoxColumnValue",
      "signature": "void SetTextBoxColumnValue(int * pTextData, int nColumn, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Stores a value at a column offset in a text data structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTextData pointer is not null\n2. Validate pTextData[0] equals 4 (type check)\n3. Validate nColumn index is non-negative\n4. Store nValue at pTextData[nColumn + 0x1f]\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Pointer to text data structure\n- nColumn (int): Column index (must be >= 0)\n- nValue (int): Value to store\n\nReturns:\n- void",
