      "name": "SetOrClearBitMaskValidated",
      "signature": "void SetOrClearBitMaskValidated(void * pTextBlock, int nMask)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validates TextBlock structure and recursively sets/clears bit mask on it and child blocks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call SetOrClearBitMask on current block\n2. Validate block pointer is not NULL\n3. Validate first field equals 4 (type check)\n4. If child block pointer (offset 0x24) exists, recursively apply mask\n\nParameters:\n- pTextBlock (void*): TextBlock structure pointer\n- nMask (int): Bit mask to set or clear\n\nReturns:\n- void (asserts on validation failure)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
