      "name": "ResetTimerData",
      "signature": "void ResetTimerData(TimerData * pTimerData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validates and resets timer data structure to initial state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pTimerData->eType equals 0x8 (timer type constant)\n2. If validation fails, log assertion error with source file and line number\n3. Call FUN_6f91436d with error code 0xffffffff to terminate process\n4. Zero the dwActiveState field at offset 0x30 to reset timer state\n\nParameters:\n- pTimerData (TimerData*): Pointer to timer data structure (required to have eType=0x8)\n\nReturns:\n- void (function does not return if type validation fails)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: Expected timer type constant (type validation check)\n- 0x30 (48): Byte offset to active state field",
