      "name": "DisplayRuntimeError",
      "signature": "void DisplayRuntimeError(uint dwErrorCode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Displays runtime error message from error code table or generic error dialog.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search error code table for matching error ID\n2. If found and conditions met, output message via WriteFile to stdout\n3. Otherwise, get program name via GetModuleFileNameA\n4. Format error dialog with program name, error string, and error code\n5. Display formatted error message box via MessageBoxA\n\nParameters:\n- nErrorCode (uint): Error code to display (index into error table)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH for GetModuleFileNameA buffer\n- 0x3c (60): Max path length before ellipsis truncation\n- 0xfffffff4 (-12): STD_OUTPUT_HANDLE for WriteFile\n- 0x12010: MB_ICONERROR | MB_OK flags for MessageBoxA",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
